&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In addition, we offer competitive equity as well as a full benefits package which may vary by geography as well.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary + Commission &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
